      "side": 1,
      "message": "In case of legacy mode context entries we return -EBUSY in this case, while here we return 0?\n\nIs this just an omission, or maybe the host driver actually updates an already present SM context entry in some cases? If the latter, then this is buggy (we should update it as the host asks us to, rather than do nothing)?",
