      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t we clear the PASID directory after donating it? Otherwise, it may have present entries pointing to arbitrary page tables?\n\nBTW in v6.18 we pass a `clear` flag to pkvm_\\*_donate_\\*() for that. (But here in v6.12 we can just manually memset() it here.)",
